sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Web
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant RAG as Knowledge Retrieval
  participant Mem as Memory Retrieval
  participant LLM as Model Provider
  User->>Web: Send prompt
  Web->>API: POST /api/chat
  API->>DB: Load recent conversation
  API->>RAG: Retrieve relevant chunks
  RAG->>DB: Search indexed chunks
  API->>Mem: Retrieve relevant saved memories
  Mem->>DB: Search user memories
  API->>LLM: Prompt + bounded context
  LLM-->>API: Assistant answer
  API->>DB: Persist user and assistant messages
  API-->>Web: Answer + source metadata
  Web-->>User: Render response
